(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-know/src/render.asl#brandWords" :text "the leading words an index purpose drops: names of the language and praise (Pure, AgentSlang, ASL, Native, Standalone, Sovereign, 100%, Self-Hosted and the like)")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-know/src/render.asl#indexPurpose" :text "the purpose an L0 index line shows: leading brandWords dropped (the whole purpose when only they remain), then cut at a word within indexPurposeBytes")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-know/src/render.asl#Group" :text "A group of cards for the tiered L0: id, purpose and member card ids")
